				<pubDate>Thu, 23 Apr 2020 19:09:47 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Zander Lassiter</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6355729</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>&quot;I struggled to find the connection to frisbee as she placed her hand on my shoulder.&quot;<br /> What does this mean. Nothing in the article references frisbee. I'm guessing this line was left in from an earlier draft.<br /> Also, you refer to people getting ill and disappearing after a few days, but the effects of interacting with the M&amp;Ms seem to occur as soon as they finish eating and the witness was immediately followed to his apartment. There is no time for people to be ill for days before they disappear. If the main character were harassed by the m&amp;ms for a few days before finally giving in, then that line would make more sense</p> 
				 	]]>
